{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他舍不得过去自在的日子，想到以后不能再那样生活就心慌，于是提醒自己受过的气，别因心软忘记当初为什么离开。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、心慌、克制、矛盾\",\n      \"missed\": \"外在像给别人看的舞步、心里却哼着旧歌的反差；旋律像腿脚发虚的人还在挪步的画面；以及反复说我没事、整理衣服再抬头的自我控制细节。这些需要读小字。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他依然舍不得过去的好日子，努力提醒自己曾经受过的气，不让自己心软，但内心仍然不甘心就此放弃。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、焦灼、压抑、不甘\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的音乐猛然推进又退下、三连音催得呼吸越来越急、最后仍没落稳等细节不容易一眼抓到；自我控制和整理衣服的动作也需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想留住过去自在生活的美好，又记得离开是因为受过伤，因此努力克制心软，却始终不甘心连那些好日子也一起舍弃。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、心慌、焦灼、矛盾、不甘\",\n      \"missed\": \"音乐起伏、呼吸被三连音催急、最后没有落稳的具体过程，以及舞步和自我控制的对应关系，都藏在较小的说明文字里；下方金色线点能看出音乐在变化，但不能直接看出人物的具体处境。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条大字都比较长，视觉权重又接近，第一眼虽然能抓到不舍、心慌、提醒自己受过的气和不甘心，但需要自己把几条话串成完整的心理过程。真正把人物感受落到具体画面上的舞步、旧歌、呼吸急促、整理衣服等细节都在小字里，下方动画又比较抽象。因此人物的情绪主线是连贯的，但事、感受和音乐画面还不能在第一眼完全融为一体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5c04aa0c-fe1e-45e7-9fb7-809d188e9e65", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001009878131Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:12:01.861198+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e79825731d9fa3752f3a0dcdbaad23a62a5d129e0e8ad223364445ee386925db", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001009878131Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4b325480488167cfaa3dcdab2df2a47f851438dfde3ab38acad29688fbba52dd"}}}
